{"_id":"9c8eefa0fe11e3d2","name":"Pleiades (The Fae Sisters)","type":"npc","img":"icons/creatures/magical/elemental-earth.webp","system":{"details":{"level":1,"className":"Aeon","race":"medium","biography":"<p>Two entities, the Maiden and the Pythoness, are summoned together. They share one HP and MP pool, but otherwise act as two separate creatures. A primary action granting Pleiades a full turn grants a full turn to both sisters.</p>"},"attributes":{"str":{"score":10},"vit":{"score":10},"agi":{"score":10},"int":{"score":10},"mnd":{"score":10},"cha":{"score":10}},"skills":{"perception":{"trained":true},"spellcraft":{"trained":true},"unarmed":{"trained":true}},"defences":{"ref":{"total":23},"fort":{"total":23},"will":{"total":27}},"resources":{"hp":{"value":77,"max":77,"baseMax":77},"mp":{"value":91,"max":91}},"combat":{"creatureSize":"medium","speed":6,"baseSpeed":6,"initiativeDie":"1d20","damageReduction":5,"baseDamageReduction":5,"immunities":[],"resistances":[],"vulnerabilities":[]},"aeon":{"isAeon":true,"aeonId":"pleiades","name":"Pleiades","epithet":"The Fae Sisters","affinity":"piercing","size":"medium","reach":0,"speed":{"land":6,"hover":true},"description":"Two entities, the Maiden and the Pythoness, are summoned together. They share one HP and MP pool, but otherwise act as two separate creatures. A primary action granting Pleiades a full turn grants a full turn to both sisters.","features":[{"name":"Duality","description":"Resistant to holy damage. The Maiden is weak to dark damage; the Pythoness is weak to fire. Green Magicks that deal piercing damage use d8s instead of d6s."},{"name":"Swarm Attack","description":"The Pythoness's sting attacks all enemies in a 4-square cone. A target occupying more than one square in the area takes +1 damage die.","automation":{"kind":"aeonAction","actionId":"swarmAttack"}},{"name":"Genesis","ultimate":true,"description":"All-out action: attack the Reflex Defence of all enemies within 6 squares of the Pythoness. On a hit 